    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "growth and self awareness doesnt really matter when u feel like u failed at the one thing u were supposed to be for. like, what's the point of growing if the end result is just being a background character? everyone else is out there actually doing things, and im just stuck in this loop of being slightly above average but never actually significant. it feels like i'm just taking up space.",
